# Phase 5.B.19 — Migrate LSP request channel call sites to Editor

## Context

5.B.18b scaffolded all LSP per-feature request channel fields onto `Editor` (in `lattice-host/src/editor.rs`). However, the ~50 duplicated field declarations were left on `App` and all call sites still reference `self.pending_*` / `a.pending_*` against the `App` struct. 5.B.19 completes the migration: update call sites, move non-default boot initializations into the `editor` block, then delete the now-redundant fields from `App`.

After this commit, `App` retains:
- `editor: Editor` (the composition root)
- `document`, `snapshot_cache`, `pane_tree` (deferred — needs `Editor::new`)
- `folds`, `visible_highlights_key` (deferred — type promotion follow-ups)
- `popup_back_stack` (deferred — `PopupSnapshot` type promotion)
- Completion cluster: `completion_registry`, `completion_state`, `insert_completion`, etc. (next cluster)
- `lsp_file_watcher` (deferred — `LspFileWatcher` type move)
- `pane_render_registry`, `theme` (renderer-specific, permanent)

